{
 "id": "kontext-turnaround",
 "name": "Turnaround sheet \u00b7 Flux Kontext (12 GB)",
 "media": "image",
 "description": "Describe one item or character in words; the agent draws the front view (Flux schnell, 4 steps), then Flux Kontext redraws that same object from the left, back and right, and the four views are stitched into a 2\u00d72 turnaround sheet (front, left / back, right) for the 3D agent. Every view is one item on pure white with no labels. Needs the Kontext model file (about 12 GB, see requires). Roughly 3\u20136 min per side view on an RTX 3060. Or upload your own front-view picture and only the side views are generated.",
 "requires": {
